          "summary": "The manuscript is a generic template lacking essential study details: the research question, population, exposure/outcome definitions are missing. Survival probabilities are reported without corresponding time points, no confidence intervals, and no comparative test. The analysis is exploratory but not clearly labeled as such. These issues prevent any meaningful interpretation and would block publication.",
